flowchart TD
    subgraph Remote Clusters [Remote Kubernetes Clusters]
        K8s1{{Kubernetes API Server US1}}
        K8s2{{Kubernetes API Server EU1}}
        K8s3{{Kubernetes API Server AP1}}
    end

    subgraph KSA [Kubernetes State Aggregation Server Daemon]
        SyncMgr[Sync Manager<br/>Dynamic Informers & Startup Reconciliation]
        DB[(PostgreSQL Database<br/>Resources, Metadata & Graph Indices)]
        StateAPI[gRPC StateService Server<br/>Port :50051]

        SyncMgr --> |Upserts / Deletes State| DB
        DB --> |Reads State & Graph Traversal| StateAPI
    end

    K8s1 -.-> |Watches & Discovers Resources| SyncMgr
    K8s2 -.-> |Watches & Discovers Resources| SyncMgr
    K8s3 -.-> |Watches & Discovers Resources| SyncMgr

    Client["ksactl CLI / gRPC Clients<br/>(get, describe, graph)"]
    Client --> |Calls RPCs over gRPC| StateAPI